### Credentials and Experience of Anxiety Therapists in Houston, Texas

Riaz Counseling features two clearly described professionals. Mishaal Riaz holds an M.A. in Professional Counseling from Amberton University and a B.S. in Psychology from Dallas Baptist University. She is a Licensed Professional Counselor in Texas. Her background includes eight years of social work and crisis counseling across multiple settings.

Dr. Riaz Rahman is a board-certified physician in Internal Medicine and Psychiatry with 24 years of combined experience. He graduated from Dow Medical University with honors and completed two residencies, later serving in leadership roles at institutions, hospitals, and long-term care facilities.

